; The thin corpus's yield-strip bar (40 x 10 x 10 pulled at 10 MPa, yield 250 MPa
; but 10 MPa in a 0.02 mm strip across it), the strip moved to x -17.9: inside the
; 2 mm support margin of the fix at x < -19 (its cells are near_support).
; truth: safe fails about 1 (statics: 1000 N over 100 mm2 against the strip's 10 MPa)
(import "std")
(def part (box 40 10 10))
(study s (shape part) (elastic (E 200000MPa) (nu 0.3) (yield (* 1MPa (select (max (- -17.9 x) (- x (+ -17.9 0.02))) 10 250))))
 (fix root (+ x 19)) (load pull (force 1000N 0 0) (region (- 19 x))) (res 1))
(require safe (min-safety-factor s > 2))
